1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,540
Siz Shahzodani taniysiz,

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:03,770
lekin uning haqiqiy ismini bilasizmi?

3
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:06,260
Oʻzbekistonning eng mashhur estrada

4
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:08,440
yulduzlaridan biri Shahzodaning asl ismi

5
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:09,740
Zilola Musayeva.

6
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:12,580
U yakkaxon ijodini boshlashdan oldin «Jonim»

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,710
guruhida qoʻshiq kuylagan,

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:16,280
keyinchalik Shahzoda taxallusi bilan sahnaga

9
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,200
chiqib, katta mashhurlikka erishgan.

10
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:20,880
Uning qoʻshiqlari Oʻzbekistondan tashqarida

11
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,170
ham tinglovchilar topgan.

12
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,500
Eng qizigʻi, millionlab odamlar uni

13
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,100
tugʻilgandagi ismi bilan emas,

14
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:28,380
sahnadagi taxallusi bilan taniydi.

15
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,840
Sizningcha, Shahzodaning eng zoʻr qoʻshigʻi

16
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:31,550
qaysi?
